From Hidden Brain Media, I'm Shankar Vedanta. This is My Unsung Hero. Stories where one person reached out to help another in a time of need. This story is about two unsung heroes. I don't even know if it was a man or a woman. Someone I will probably never know. My eighth grade English teacher, my unsung hero. Today's story comes from Liyabata.
来自隐秘大脑传媒，我是尚卡尔·维丹塔姆。这是《无名英雄》。这里讲述的是一个人在他人需要时伸出援手的故事。这个故事关于两位无名英雄。我甚至不知道那是男是女。一个我可能永远不会知道的人。我八年级的英语老师，我的无名英雄。今天的故事来自莉亚巴塔。

